WEBVTT

00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:02.240
It is the period of warring states.

00:00:02.240 --> 00:00:03.970
The era of competing warlords.

00:00:04.580 --> 00:00:11.450
Many of these warlords clashed blades ruthlessly, aiming for conquest of the country.

00:00:12.800 --> 00:00:16.630
Among them, Toyotomi Hideyoshi was only a short step away from seizing total power.

00:00:16.630 --> 00:00:22.660
But his ambitions were cut short by 
Tokugawa Ieyasu, who had sworn loyalty to him.

00:00:23.850 --> 00:00:27.420
Tokugawa Ieyasu's rebellion planted the seeds of a new wave of conflicts.

00:00:28.460 --> 00:00:30.960
Samurai who have been split apart by fate...

00:00:32.220 --> 00:00:35.180
It will all lead up to Sekigahara.

00:02:01.240 --> 00:02:02.890
I hereby proclaim:

00:02:04.150 --> 00:02:10.050
With the power of bonds, I will unite the 
Land of the Rising Sun, and rid this country of war.

00:02:10.050 --> 00:02:13.030
For that purpose, lend me your strength...

00:02:13.030 --> 00:02:14.990
The strength of your bond with me! {holy fuck is this gay or what}

00:02:18.410 --> 00:02:23.290
I'm now heading out to form more bonds with like-minded people.

00:02:23.740 --> 00:02:25.120
Take care of things while I'm gone.

00:02:26.490 --> 00:02:27.670
Ieyasu.

00:02:28.540 --> 00:02:30.830
It's dangerous to enter enemy territory on your own.

00:02:30.830 --> 00:02:32.180
I'll come with you.

00:02:32.180 --> 00:02:33.260
Don't worry.

00:02:33.260 --> 00:02:36.460
Tadakatsu, the strongest man in the land, will be with me.

00:02:37.750 --> 00:02:42.770
Alliance

00:02:42.770 --> 00:02:47.810
The coming war will be bigger than any other that has come before.

00:02:47.810 --> 00:02:50.360
That means more people will die.

00:02:50.930 --> 00:02:52.340
And not just enemy soldiers.

00:02:52.340 --> 00:02:55.820
I will probably be sending my followers to their deaths as well.

00:02:56.890 --> 00:03:00.060
But it can't be stopped anymore.

00:03:00.060 --> 00:03:01.080
<i>Meanwhile,</i>

00:03:01.080 --> 00:03:04.660
<i>Takeda Shingen, who had collapsed during the battle with Tokugawa,</i>

00:03:04.660 --> 00:03:08.670
<i>still had not regained consciousness, and lay in his sickbed.</i>

00:03:08.670 --> 00:03:10.060
Oyakata-sama.

00:03:10.060 --> 00:03:11.960
Please open your eyes!

00:03:11.960 --> 00:03:15.140
Without you, I am...

00:03:15.140 --> 00:03:19.470
Master, I understand how you feel, but you need to stop this.

00:03:19.470 --> 00:03:22.330
You're the head of the Takeda now. {is general the right word here}{head?}

00:03:22.330 --> 00:03:24.980
You better shape up or everyone will suffer for it.

00:03:27.310 --> 00:03:31.070
Only Oyakata-sama can lead the Takeda of Kai.

00:03:31.070 --> 00:03:33.320
I am merely one of his subordinates.

00:03:35.160 --> 00:03:40.830
<i>At the same time, the Toyotomi made another move to counter Tokugawa.</i>

00:03:42.580 --> 00:03:45.770
I thought you'd be here, Mitsunari.

00:03:45.770 --> 00:03:47.390
What is it, Gyoubu?

00:03:47.390 --> 00:03:49.210
We have news.

00:03:49.210 --> 00:03:52.970
Tokugawa has raised an allied force in the east.

00:03:53.920 --> 00:03:57.930
So, he's deceiving people yet again 
with his lofty speeches about bonds? {is boast the right word}{I guess. like tall talk}

00:03:57.930 --> 00:04:01.510
What can the foolish people who believe him do to us?

00:04:01.510 --> 00:04:05.020
But what if he ensnares the most elite mercenary?

00:04:05.520 --> 00:04:06.880
Saika?

00:04:06.880 --> 00:04:08.020
None other.

00:04:08.020 --> 00:04:10.820
It would be typical of him to do so.

00:04:10.820 --> 00:04:11.800
I won't allow it!

00:04:11.800 --> 00:04:14.530
Saika made a contract with Hideyoshi-sama!

00:04:14.530 --> 00:04:17.900
Joining up with Tokugawa would be an ultimate betrayal!

00:04:17.900 --> 00:04:20.840
To borrow Saika's words on that...

00:04:20.840 --> 00:04:24.620
"A contract is nullified upon death of the one who signed it{contractee?}."{cant get the rest of this line}{契約主の死は契約の無効を意味する}

00:04:24.620 --> 00:04:30.040
Even so, I won't forgive her if she contracts with Ieyasu!

00:04:31.500 --> 00:04:33.290
<i>Just as Ootani's intel suggested,</i>

00:04:33.290 --> 00:04:37.590
<i>Tokugawa Ieyasu had arrived at the Saika village,</i>

00:04:37.590 --> 00:04:40.300
<i>home of elite mercenary Saika Magoichi.</i>

00:04:40.300 --> 00:04:41.760
Saika    Brigade

00:04:41.760 --> 00:04:48.560
So, the same man who killed Lord Toyotomi Hideyoshi wants to form a contract with the Saika brigade?{criminal might be too extreme}

00:04:48.560 --> 00:04:49.930
Magoichi.

00:04:49.930 --> 00:04:54.530
I want to unite this land with the power of bonds.

00:04:54.530 --> 00:04:56.920
I want to create a world without war.

00:04:56.920 --> 00:04:58.650
Will you lend me your aid?

00:04:58.650 --> 00:05:01.160
What if I said I'd refuse?

00:05:01.160 --> 00:05:03.170
I've no intention of forcing you.

00:05:03.170 --> 00:05:06.310
But, I believe our goals are the same.

00:05:06.310 --> 00:05:08.000
We are mercenaries.

00:05:08.000 --> 00:05:10.270
I await your favorable reply.

00:05:17.380 --> 00:05:20.380
Saika's village is a nice place.

00:05:21.340 --> 00:05:26.600
Tadakatsu, can we stay here for a while instead of going back to Mikawa?

00:05:28.420 --> 00:05:29.850
<i>At the same time,</i>

00:05:29.850 --> 00:05:34.990
<i>one more man headed to the Saika village, chasing after Ieyasu.</i>

00:05:35.500 --> 00:05:37.140
This is Ieyasu we're talking about.

00:05:37.140 --> 00:05:40.110
He would definitely come negotiate with Sayaka directly. {check}{話を付ける so it's fine}

00:05:40.110 --> 00:05:41.800
Just you wait, Ieyasu.

00:05:41.800 --> 00:05:43.610
I'm gonna beat you to a pulp.

00:05:47.160 --> 00:05:48.120
Hidden Miko

00:05:47.160 --> 00:05:48.120
of Kouno

00:05:47.160 --> 00:05:48.120
Iyo province 
Shikoku

00:05:48.120 --> 00:05:49.160
Tsuruhime

00:05:49.160 --> 00:05:50.950
Whaddya think you're doing, huh?

00:05:50.950 --> 00:05:54.670
Did you follow me all the way from
 the Seto Sea? Talk about persistent! {i am not sure how to tl that}{"Talk about persistent!"?}{is Seito seas correct?}{I know Seto Sea but dunno if seito exists}{could be seto}

00:05:54.670 --> 00:05:59.670
Evil pirate! You wrought havoc on my waters!

00:05:59.670 --> 00:06:04.720
No matter where you try to hide, I'll always find you!

00:06:04.720 --> 00:06:08.310
I won't let Magoichi-neesama be infected by your poison!

00:06:08.310 --> 00:06:10.470
I don't have any business with Sayaka.

00:06:10.470 --> 00:06:13.090
It's one of her customers I want.

00:06:13.090 --> 00:06:14.520
Let me pass.

00:06:14.520 --> 00:06:16.030
I don't believe you!

00:06:16.030 --> 00:06:17.700
Pirates are bad people!

00:06:17.700 --> 00:06:20.400
I, the miko of Watatsumi, shall punish you!

00:06:21.400 --> 00:06:24.780
You impudent, naive girl. {can this be stronger}

00:06:24.780 --> 00:06:28.200
A hard slap of reality will put an end to your daydreaming.

00:06:28.200 --> 00:06:34.200
A lovely maiden's battle to protect
 Magoichi-neesama is about to begin!

00:06:40.140 --> 00:06:44.830
I'll send you crying right back to your shrine!

00:06:48.970 --> 00:06:50.060
What a rotten mouth you have!

00:06:50.490 --> 00:06:51.930
She's too quick.

00:07:06.640 --> 00:07:08.370
Hey, how dare you ignore people like that!

00:07:08.370 --> 00:07:11.040
That's right! I'm sure he glanced at us!

00:07:12.470 --> 00:07:14.580
I have no business with you.

00:07:14.580 --> 00:07:16.620
My destination is further ahead.

00:07:16.620 --> 00:07:19.180
Hey, hey! I was first in line!

00:07:19.180 --> 00:07:20.490
Wait your turn!

00:07:20.490 --> 00:07:22.350
Another visitor for Magoichi-neesama?

00:07:22.350 --> 00:07:24.300
She really is popular! Kya~

00:07:25.430 --> 00:07:28.530
Well, it doesn't matter if you have business with Sayaka.

00:07:28.530 --> 00:07:30.740
My business is with Ieyasu.

00:07:31.680 --> 00:07:34.430
Ieyasu... you say?

00:07:34.430 --> 00:07:36.070
Yeah, Ieyasu.

00:07:36.070 --> 00:07:36.940
I've got—

00:07:37.380 --> 00:07:39.440
Are you his ally?!

00:07:39.440 --> 00:07:42.010
Ally? No way.

00:07:42.010 --> 00:07:45.440
He's my enemy, the one that I'm gonna beat up.

00:07:50.680 --> 00:07:51.840
What's with you?

00:07:51.840 --> 00:07:53.290
Are you his ally?

00:07:53.290 --> 00:07:56.960
I am the one who will cut down Ieyasu!

00:07:57.810 --> 00:08:00.000
So you're in the same boat, huh?

00:08:00.000 --> 00:08:02.340
Ieyasu sure has plenty of enemies.

00:08:02.340 --> 00:08:05.920
But I won't let you do that!

00:08:15.860 --> 00:08:17.460
Um...

00:08:19.990 --> 00:08:21.480
It's Ieyasu-san!

00:08:24.820 --> 00:08:26.690
Ieyasu!

00:08:24.820 --> 00:08:26.690
Ieyasu!

00:08:27.400 --> 00:08:28.490
Dammit.

00:08:28.490 --> 00:08:30.860
Ieyasu...

00:08:40.500 --> 00:08:43.060
So, after Tokugawa comes Ishida, huh.

00:08:44.210 --> 00:08:46.100
I ask you—

00:08:46.100 --> 00:08:49.880
Did you betray Hideyoshi-sama and swear allegiance to Ieyasu?

00:08:49.880 --> 00:08:53.140
Oh? Does Tokugawa bother you?

00:08:54.060 --> 00:08:58.540
Our only allegiance is to ourselves. We want no other master. {check}{fine}

00:08:58.540 --> 00:09:02.650
I don't care who a customer is, as long as they can pay the appropriate price,

00:09:02.650 --> 00:09:08.210
Whether it's Tokugawa, or your former master, the "supreme ruler."

00:09:08.210 --> 00:09:10.400
Damn you, you dare to...

00:09:10.400 --> 00:09:14.170
If the contractor dies, the contract is void.

00:09:14.170 --> 00:09:16.990
Our contract with Toyotomi Hideyoshi is finished.

00:09:16.990 --> 00:09:19.410
Don't speak of Hideyoshi-sama so rudely!

00:09:22.030 --> 00:09:24.750
After I kill Ieyasu, I'll kill you all.

00:09:24.750 --> 00:09:27.170
I'll wipe out the Saika mercenaries.

00:09:27.170 --> 00:09:31.680
We're not childish enough to take offense at your irrationality.

00:09:31.680 --> 00:09:36.850
But, if you ask for another contract with us, 
then we'll certainly take it into consideration.{something}{吟味 is what i hear}

00:09:41.940 --> 00:09:44.340
Form a contract with the Toyotomi.

00:09:44.340 --> 00:09:46.040
I won't permit you to refuse. {check}{sure}

00:09:47.760 --> 00:09:49.360
Sneakily...

00:09:52.610 --> 00:09:55.350
Neesama, that person is scary.

00:09:55.350 --> 00:09:56.990
Is that Lord Bad-Man?{kyoou-san?}{凶王}{King of unlucky? maybe Mr. Unlucky?}{no it means closer to 凶悪 like brutal, merciless}{Mr. Evil?}{keep king/lord since it's his nickname?}{Lord Evil sounds so dumb omg}{w}{or just Tyrant or something}

00:09:56.990 --> 00:09:57.760
Yeah.

00:09:59.030 --> 00:10:01.660
Toyotomi's orphan. {woudl thsi be correct}{figuratively?}{yah, he's obvioulys not toyotoimi's kid}{why not}

00:10:04.620 --> 00:10:06.370
Ieyasu...

00:10:06.370 --> 00:10:08.040
Ishida Mitsunari!

00:10:09.880 --> 00:10:11.810
I've been waiting for you.

00:10:14.200 --> 00:10:15.600
<i>Odawara Castle.</i>

00:10:15.600 --> 00:10:18.310
<i>It was the home of the glorious Houjou family.</i>

00:10:18.750 --> 00:10:25.810
<i>But it's been rusting since the recent Toyotomi 
invasion, and lost its value as a base of defense.</i>

00:10:25.810 --> 00:10:28.070
What should I do?

00:10:31.140 --> 00:10:32.690
Wh-What is it now?

00:10:32.690 --> 00:10:35.210
Will you bully an old man even further?

00:10:35.210 --> 00:10:36.070
Houjou-dono!

00:10:36.070 --> 00:10:39.200
I was your enemy, but now I am your ally.

00:10:39.200 --> 00:10:41.220
M-My ally?

00:10:41.220 --> 00:10:43.700
I'm glad you are alive, Houjou-dono.

00:10:43.700 --> 00:10:47.210
Please join forces with the Tokugawa.

00:10:47.210 --> 00:10:50.640
To-Tokugawa...

00:10:54.470 --> 00:10:56.280
"I was", huh.

00:10:56.280 --> 00:10:59.600
Even so, I must push forward.

00:11:00.730 --> 00:11:02.100
<i>Meanwhile,</i>

00:11:02.100 --> 00:11:06.100
<i>there was yet another man who came to the Saika village in pursuit of Ieyasu.</i>

00:11:09.860 --> 00:11:11.720
Maeda Keiji

00:11:11.730 --> 00:11:12.820
Neesama,

00:11:12.820 --> 00:11:14.360
what are you thinking about?

00:11:15.660 --> 00:11:19.590
You're good enough at telling fortunes to figure that out, 'Hime.

00:11:19.590 --> 00:11:25.530
Lord Bad-Man came seeking a contract with you, just like Ieyasu-san, right?

00:11:25.530 --> 00:11:26.500
Yeah.

00:11:26.500 --> 00:11:29.220
So, what are you going to do?

00:11:29.950 --> 00:11:32.380
We have to make the right decision.  {can there be a better way to tl that}{We have to make the right decision?}

00:11:32.820 --> 00:11:40.860
Do we side with Tokugawa's intention to unite the land with bonds, or with Ishida, who inherits the will of Toyotomi to rule it by force?

00:11:41.390 --> 00:11:43.660
We have to choose one of them.

00:11:43.660 --> 00:11:46.640
How about neither?

00:11:51.960 --> 00:11:53.090
Who're you?!

00:11:53.090 --> 00:11:54.240
I just want...

00:11:55.410 --> 00:11:56.530
What's going on?

00:11:56.530 --> 00:12:00.160
Well, I just wanted to know if Ieyasu came here or not...

00:12:03.600 --> 00:12:04.820
What?

00:12:04.820 --> 00:12:07.370
Is there something on my face?

00:12:07.370 --> 00:12:09.160
Er, no...{blushing Keiji, so kawaii}

00:12:10.420 --> 00:12:13.090
I'm Maeda—Maeda Keiji.

00:12:13.090 --> 00:12:14.630
And what business have you here?

00:12:14.630 --> 00:12:20.640
Well, actually, my aunt was kidnapped by Ieyasu. {what?? i didnt hear about this}

00:12:20.640 --> 00:12:22.960
Her name is Matsu.

00:12:23.680 --> 00:12:25.670
Maeda Toshiie's wife?

00:12:25.670 --> 00:12:27.500
Tokugawa kidnapped her?

00:12:29.020 --> 00:12:31.150
You know her?

00:12:31.150 --> 00:12:32.580
I know the name.

00:12:32.580 --> 00:12:35.810
So, that's why you're pursuing Tokugawa?

00:12:35.810 --> 00:12:39.990
Unfortunately, he left here some time ago.

00:12:40.900 --> 00:12:42.280
I was too late again, huh.

00:12:42.280 --> 00:12:48.540
Maeda, do you really believe that Tokugawa is the one who kidnapped Matsu?

00:12:49.920 --> 00:12:51.580
He killed Hideyoshi.

00:12:51.980 --> 00:12:54.950
There's someone I don't know inside him.

00:12:55.460 --> 00:12:58.150
Perhaps I shouldn't butt in, but you've come this far.

00:12:58.150 --> 00:12:59.800
I'll give you some advice.

00:12:59.800 --> 00:13:01.490
There is only one truth.

00:13:01.490 --> 00:13:04.630
To reach it, you've got to gather information.

00:13:05.280 --> 00:13:06.450
I like it.

00:13:06.450 --> 00:13:08.310
You're a good woman!

00:13:08.310 --> 00:13:10.190
I realized it the moment I saw you.

00:13:12.120 --> 00:13:13.800
You've got no real reason to help me.

00:13:13.800 --> 00:13:16.610
But since I <i>have</i> come this far, would you consider it?   {check}{basic meaning is fine}

00:13:16.610 --> 00:13:20.460
You know, they say Saika's intel is the best in the land!

00:13:20.460 --> 00:13:22.600
If you helped me, I'd feel reassured—

00:13:22.600 --> 00:13:25.330
I mean, I want to be with you...

00:13:26.820 --> 00:13:29.370
So, you wish to make a contract with us?

00:13:29.370 --> 00:13:30.550
A contract?

00:13:30.550 --> 00:13:32.480
Well, that might work.

00:13:32.480 --> 00:13:34.920
But, I have no money.

00:13:34.920 --> 00:13:37.700
Well, I have land—Kaga province. {check}{Province instead of country for consistency?}

00:13:39.000 --> 00:13:41.730
You'd give me Kaga province in order to search for someone?

00:13:41.730 --> 00:13:44.080
A whole province is our asking price?

00:13:46.480 --> 00:13:47.860
Interesting.

00:13:56.860 --> 00:14:03.280
We, the proud Saika brigade,{kaga maeda koku?}{sure} have now made a 
contract with Lord Maeda of Kaga province. {I think Maeda is the ruler?}{how to tl this then?}{made a contract with Lord Maeda of/'s Kaga Province?}{hmm ok}

00:14:03.280 --> 00:14:04.540
Let it ring!

00:14:04.540 --> 00:14:06.910
Let the song of our flames resound!

00:14:09.160 --> 00:14:11.060
My prediction was right!

00:14:13.840 --> 00:14:18.500
From now until the flames of our lives burn out, we will be your strength. {check}{sure}

00:14:19.380 --> 00:14:23.010
Tokugawa, Ishida, this is our decision.

00:14:23.010 --> 00:14:24.710
She's so cool...

00:14:25.340 --> 00:14:27.720
I think I'm in love.

00:14:29.920 --> 00:14:31.770
So this is Osaka Castle?

00:14:31.770 --> 00:14:34.360
It's as big as the rumors say.

00:14:36.020 --> 00:14:38.350
So you've come back, Mitsunari.

00:14:38.350 --> 00:14:39.280
Gyoubu.

00:14:39.280 --> 00:14:40.530
What is that?

00:14:40.530 --> 00:14:43.610
The remnants of Owari and Oda.

00:14:43.610 --> 00:14:44.710
Oda?

00:14:44.710 --> 00:14:46.990
What business do the Devil King's remaining followers have with us?

00:14:46.990 --> 00:14:52.100
They say that their leader, Oichi-dono, was captured by Tokugawa. {check}

00:14:52.100 --> 00:14:53.410
By Ieyasu?

00:14:53.810 --> 00:15:00.390
It seems Tokugawa's "power of bonds"
 actually means the binding of chains with force.

00:15:00.390 --> 00:15:02.210
By the way, Mitsunari.

00:15:02.210 --> 00:15:04.000
How did things with Saika go?

00:15:04.900 --> 00:15:08.240
They will once more kneel before Hideyoshi-sama.

00:15:08.240 --> 00:15:11.500
Though, it looks like you've picked up something along the way.

00:15:12.120 --> 00:15:14.090
So you finally noticed me?

00:15:14.090 --> 00:15:16.630
This person followed me here of his own will.

00:15:16.630 --> 00:15:19.480
But he does add strength to our side.

00:15:19.940 --> 00:15:22.500
It's been a long time, Bat. {wut, thats not his name}{what is koomori}{apparently his nickname was "bat" (koumori)?}{whaa for real?}

00:15:22.500 --> 00:15:25.240
I must give thanks if you are to become our ally,

00:15:25.240 --> 00:15:26.790
Chousokabe.

00:15:26.790 --> 00:15:29.660
That's right. I expect a welcoming—{something}{丁重にもてなしsomething}{isnt it more like, "thanks for the hospitality—-}{chouskabe isnt a guy to use the word "courteous"}{well u know the chars better than me!}{lel you just tl'd his argument with that archer girl, icant even understand it bcause he speaks so roughly, it needs to be reviewed again}{yeah that needs some time}

00:15:28.680 --> 00:15:30.500
Returning to the previous conversation.

00:15:30.500 --> 00:15:31.240
Hey!

00:15:31.240 --> 00:15:34.330
Tokugawa not only has Oichi-dono,

00:15:34.330 --> 00:15:40.090
but I hear he has cajoled Houjou-dono into giving him the legendary ninja Fuuma.

00:15:41.060 --> 00:15:44.060
And now he's even trying to get Saika.

00:15:44.060 --> 00:15:47.680
He's gathering quite a fierce collection of pawns.

00:15:48.310 --> 00:15:49.850
Ieyasu...

00:15:51.600 --> 00:15:55.090
So, you <i>have </i>changed, Ieyasu.

00:15:55.090 --> 00:15:57.860
Even though you looked like that back then.

00:15:58.400 --> 00:16:00.710
You want revenge on Ieyasu.

00:16:00.710 --> 00:16:03.280
I'll join your crew.

00:16:04.140 --> 00:16:06.530
And besides, I like you.

00:16:06.530 --> 00:16:09.050
Your straightforward eyes, that is.

00:16:11.280 --> 00:16:12.490
God of War.

00:16:12.490 --> 00:16:14.660
I want to form an alliance with you.

00:16:19.670 --> 00:16:23.670
A man with the same eyes as you has fallen ill,

00:16:23.670 --> 00:16:26.700
and frozen my heart. {lol is kenshin in love with oyakata-sama}

00:16:26.700 --> 00:16:30.930
Why do you bear the same tiger's eyes as that man? {kannou no otoko?}{kano otoko like "that man"}

00:16:31.300 --> 00:16:34.780
From my battle with Lord Shingen, I learned much.

00:16:35.400 --> 00:16:36.850
I learned loss.

00:16:37.410 --> 00:16:39.340
I learned strategy.

00:16:39.340 --> 00:16:40.860
I learned my path. {chekc}{sure}

00:16:41.550 --> 00:16:43.440
Lord Shingen is my teacher.

00:16:43.440 --> 00:16:47.700
If my eyes resemble those of a tiger, that must be the reason.

00:16:50.770 --> 00:16:51.700
I see.

00:16:53.060 --> 00:16:59.460
Even if you fall ill, your soul is already on the battlefield.

00:17:01.800 --> 00:17:07.560
Successor to the tiger, I intend to wait quietly until that man returns.

00:17:07.560 --> 00:17:09.460
I see. That's a shame.

00:17:11.480 --> 00:17:12.700
I will warn you. {check}

00:17:13.470 --> 00:17:16.500
Another tiger sleeps as well.

00:17:18.100 --> 00:17:19.300
I know.

00:17:28.740 --> 00:17:31.260
What business do you have here, Tokugawa-dono?

00:17:31.260 --> 00:17:34.750
Depending on your answer, I am prepared to fight you now! {check}

00:17:37.870 --> 00:17:39.800
Wait, Tadakatsu.

00:17:39.800 --> 00:17:43.320
Sanada, I did not come here to battle you today.

00:17:43.320 --> 00:17:45.380
I want to visit the sickbed of Lord Shingen.

00:17:45.380 --> 00:17:46.800
What?!

00:17:46.800 --> 00:17:51.380
It was battling with you that made him collapse in the first place!

00:17:51.380 --> 00:17:53.180
That's precisely why I...

00:17:53.720 --> 00:17:55.220
Master Tokugawa.

00:17:55.220 --> 00:17:58.670
Our leader is a bit hot-headed right now.

00:17:58.670 --> 00:18:00.730
Can you hold off for today?

00:18:02.020 --> 00:18:03.210
All right.

00:18:03.210 --> 00:18:06.150
But I will come again to visit Lord Shingen.

00:18:06.520 --> 00:18:10.060
I want to form an alliance with the Takeda.

00:18:11.280 --> 00:18:12.740
I won't allow that!

00:18:12.740 --> 00:18:15.380
I'll never accept that sort of alliance!

00:18:15.380 --> 00:18:16.940
Master! Stay calm—

00:18:16.940 --> 00:18:19.040
How can I stay calm?!

00:18:19.900 --> 00:18:21.460
Let's meet again, Sanada.

00:18:26.860 --> 00:18:28.750
Master, what will you do?

00:18:28.750 --> 00:18:31.530
As we are right now, the Takeda can't stand up to his forces.

00:18:31.530 --> 00:18:33.330
I know!

00:18:33.330 --> 00:18:38.300
But forming an alliance with an opponent after 
being defeated by him is the same as surrendering.{what?}{軍門に下る}

00:18:38.300 --> 00:18:39.830
I won't have it!

00:18:39.830 --> 00:18:41.240
I won't!

00:18:41.240 --> 00:18:42.430
Then what?

00:18:43.270 --> 00:18:45.310
You're the head of Takeda.

00:18:45.310 --> 00:18:46.840
<i>You</i> have to decide.

00:18:49.670 --> 00:18:51.150
Oyakata-sama.

00:18:51.150 --> 00:18:54.860
What would you do in this situation?

00:18:54.860 --> 00:18:56.820
I don't know what to do!

00:18:56.820 --> 00:18:59.370
Please tell me, Oyakata-sama!

00:19:13.500 --> 00:19:14.800
If it was him...

00:19:17.050 --> 00:19:19.300
He would head for the front!

00:19:25.520 --> 00:19:28.670
Fights with you are something else!

00:19:34.740 --> 00:19:37.370
You'll be just another fallen flower in my lord's path to supremacy!

00:19:41.240 --> 00:19:42.970
Masamune-sama, you've awoken—

00:19:44.750 --> 00:19:45.870
Masamune-sama!

00:19:47.210 --> 00:19:48.310
Lord!

00:19:48.310 --> 00:19:49.250
Lord, what happened?

00:19:49.250 --> 00:19:52.590
Ishida Mitsunari!

00:19:53.520 --> 00:19:54.600
Masamune-sama!

00:19:55.240 --> 00:19:56.170
Restrain him!

00:20:00.680 --> 00:20:01.530
Let go!

00:20:01.530 --> 00:20:02.700
Let me go!

00:20:02.700 --> 00:20:04.240
Enemy attack!

00:20:13.340 --> 00:20:14.470
Shit!

00:20:14.470 --> 00:20:16.190
Are you here to mess up my garden? {check}{here to mess up this garden}

00:20:16.550 --> 00:20:19.590
Or have you come to destroy me, Ieyasu?

00:20:19.590 --> 00:20:22.700
Tokugawa, is attacking people in their beds the way you do things?

00:20:23.240 --> 00:20:25.280
Wait, this is a misunderstanding.

00:20:25.280 --> 00:20:27.210
I've not come here to fight.

00:20:27.210 --> 00:20:28.500
What?

00:20:28.500 --> 00:20:32.200
The Tokugawa wish to form an alliance with the Date of Oushuu.

00:20:32.840 --> 00:20:34.210
An alliance?

00:20:34.210 --> 00:20:37.110
I want to end this world of war.

00:20:37.110 --> 00:20:40.580
Lend me your strength, One-Eyed Dragon!

00:20:40.580 --> 00:20:43.160
Do you think the world revolves around you or something?! {check}{sure}

00:20:44.810 --> 00:20:46.530
My answer is <i>no.</i>

00:20:46.530 --> 00:20:48.600
I won't join up with anyone.

00:20:48.600 --> 00:20:51.310
Whoever wants this country can take it.

00:20:51.310 --> 00:20:53.570
I'm just gonna kill Ishida.

00:20:54.120 --> 00:20:56.110
Tadakatsu, we're leaving.

00:20:59.590 --> 00:21:00.720
Kojuurou.

00:21:00.720 --> 00:21:01.320
Yes, sir?

00:21:01.750 --> 00:21:02.740
We're heading out.

00:21:07.740 --> 00:21:09.320
We're going to Osaka!

00:21:09.320 --> 00:21:10.800
Ishida Mitsunari!

00:21:13.000 --> 00:21:13.960
Masamune-sama! {thsi fucker just up and leaves}

